            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">EIGHT THEMES TO CARRY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Across the survey course</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1. ALWAYS PLURAL</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">500+ nations in 1491</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">to majority-minority 2045</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Homogeneity was a project</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"180\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2. FREEDOM + SLAVERY</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Morgan, Gordon-Reed</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Built together at founding</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Contradiction shapes us still</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"380\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">3. CIVIL WAR REFOUNDED</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">13/14/15 Amendments</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">New constitutional order</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Rights work through 14A</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"380\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">4. INDUSTRIAL CAPITALISM</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Built modern America</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Wealth and inequality</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Regulation still contested</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"580\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">5. STATE GROWTH WAVES</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Civil War, Progressive</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">New Deal, Great Society</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Backlash after each</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"580\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">6. AMERICAN CENTURY ENDS</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">1945-2001 hegemony</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Contested since</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Next century differs</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"780\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">7. RIGHTS REAL + PARTIAL</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Movements transformed law</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"905\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">None fully achieved aims</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Inclusion + inequality grow</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"780\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">8. UNCERTAINTY</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">We don't know how it ends</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"905\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">2050 may differ wildly</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">You will help answer</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Eight themes to carry from a US history survey"
